但是啊…\n就这么放着不管的话，更是作不出表率了。%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...that is all part of an executive's duties. We are not\nat a university, and you are not a member of a union. You\nshould be prepared for overtime, working the weekends, and\neven death from overwork.\d%K%P
